pr-title: "Add CodeQL Security Scanning Workflow"
pr-body: |
  This PR adds CodeQL security scanning to this repository.
  
  ## What's included:
  - CodeQL workflow that runs on push, pull requests, pull_request_target, and weekly schedule
  - Uses the reusable workflow from Sanjana-Kondalwade/meta
  - Automatically detects the primary language
  - Configured with appropriate build mode
  
  ## Benefits:
  - Automated security vulnerability detection
  - Code quality analysis
  - Integration with GitHub Security tab
  - Weekly scheduled scans to catch new vulnerabilities
  
  ## Workflow triggers:
  - Push to main branch
  - Pull requests to main branch
  - Pull request target events
  - Weekly schedule (Monday at midnight)
  - Manual workflow dispatch
repo-include: ".*port.*"
skip-forks: false
skip-pr: false
skip-repo:
  - Sanjana-Kondalwade/meta